;. /inspect_subject_flow
  ;@ /flow/definition inspect_subject
  ;= Inspect a subject and its available actions
    This flow returns native values. Use the retain_result writer for a standalone occurrence. Compose project_result when a Nenex document is wanted. Publish the named child flows before publishing this composition; their exact definitions are captured.

    ;@ /flow/input context
    ;= context

    ;@ /flow/input sources
    ;= sources

    ;@ /flow/input provider
    ;= provider

    ;@ /flow/step task ;/0x11/gov/flows/operations/stages/orientation
    ;@ /flow/bind pages document
    ;@ /flow/bind sources sources
    ;@ /flow/bind context context
    ;= task

    ;@ /flow/step answered ;/0x11/gov/flows/operations/interactive_requests
    ;@ /flow/bind tasks task
    ;@ /flow/bind provider provider
    ;= answered

    ;@ /flow/step result ;/0x11/gov/flows/operations/stages/results
    ;@ /flow/bind responses answered
    ;= result

    ;@ /flow/result result
    ;= Inspect a subject and its available actions result

    ;@ /flow/page /
    ;= Inspect a subject and its available actions
      Inspect the selected context, its cells, holes and declared actions. This stage is read-only. Return summary, questions, next and note as separate fields. Name exact observed references in the explanation; do not invent unavailable state. Use "None observed" when no question is established. Context and sources remain captured native values alongside the proposal.
